{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國饒舌天后Nicki Minaj向來是美國總統特朗普（Donald Trump）支持者，她昨日（25日）獲邀登上總統專機「空軍一號」，於機上自拍短片上載社交網站，大讚特朗普的國際政治手腕。</p><p>白宮通訊總監張振熙亦上載與Nicki機上談話的影片</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T07:41:39.206467+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T07:25:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:16.609862+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:16.609862+00:00","content_hash":"08eb901ff9e53b0d2342ab931a241e1d2a4adb68258789c7b7301204ce03c188","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}